  "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "Donald Trump is mapped as 'that face you make when you're a bully and just got beat up by a girl'",
  "description": "The textual material 'that face you make when you're a bully and just got beat up by a girl' explicitly maps onto the visual material of Donald Trump. The text describes a specific emotional and behavioral state (a pouting, defiant face in the context of defeat) that is visually embodied by Trump in the image. The meme uses this juxtaposition to create an analogical mapping where Trump is being portrayed as the 'bully' who has been 'beaten up by a girl', and his facial expression is the visual representation of that scenario. This mapping is central to the meme's intent and relies on the visual expression being interpreted through the lens of the text.",
  "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface",
